          "version": "1.0.3",
          "description": "Sorry! for does who download 1.0.3 yesterday i fixed the Quick sort issue incase you didn encounter it items got deleted during Quick sort and if you moved items during Quick sort they glitch out\n\nNew Features\n\nQuick Sort default (G) press G while inventory is open to pack your backpack neatly top-to-bottom, largest items first Item rotation on sort non-square items are automatically rotated to fit if they don’t fit in their current orientation\n\ncurrently only sorts the backpack i will maybe removed this in the future would be nice if i get some feedback on how useful this features is :D\n\nBug fixes\n\nimproved/fixed auto search continuing to search a container or a body even tho its fully searched",
